{
  "name": "Invoice AR Chaser",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧾 INVOICE AR CHASER\n**What it does:** Every morning it lists your open Stripe invoices → computes days overdue → syncs an AR ledger in Google Sheets → sends day 1/7/14 payment reminders via Gmail → escalates 14+ day overdue invoices to Slack → sends you a Telegram summary.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- Stripe account (stripe.com → Developers → API keys)\n- Gmail OAuth2 credential\n- Slack OAuth2 credential\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credential\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `UNPAID` → `REMINDER_SENT_DAY_1` / `REMINDER_SENT_DAY_7` / `REMINDER_SENT_DAY_14` → `ESCALATED`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 4940,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "bd41e497-93b4-4338-9b13-540229a7bdb1",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Daily trigger + list open invoices\nDaily 8 AM schedule trigger fires → Stripe lists all open invoices (not yet paid).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "18e82de7-9552-4837-892c-06caa6a23062",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 2 — Days overdue + sync AR ledger\nCompute days overdue per invoice (skip not-yet-due) → read the AR sheet → append brand-new invoices as `UNPAID` → refresh days-overdue on existing rows.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c933ee30-9c09-499a-a83a-ea63e2b168c9",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 3 — Day 1/7/14 reminders\nInvoices exactly 1, 7 or 14 days overdue get a branded email: friendly reminder (day 1) → firm nudge (day 7) → final notice (day 14). Sheet flips to `REMINDER_SENT_DAY_X`.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "16e66a7b-25ab-4d73-89b1-422ca153290b",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2200,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4 — Escalation + summary\nInvoices 14+ days overdue (no reminder today) are escalated to your Slack channel → sheet flips to `ESCALATED` → branches merge → one Telegram AR summary (outstanding total, reminders sent, escalations).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1360,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6bd60f90-bf1d-45fb-9e27-b7cd7adc7bfd",
      "name": "STICKY — STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
